#: src/pages/AdminCompanyPage.tsx
msgid "Word, PDF, PowerPoint and text files attached to a chat are indexed with OpenAI in the background, so assistants find the right passages quickly instead of rereading every file. Works while the company model runs on OpenAI. Off stops indexing and removes the indexes."
